  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born amidst the toxic fumes of the Hideout Smokestack Jacks, 'Rivet' learned early that survival in Subchain City meant scavenging and scrapping. He traded his knack for cracking open defunct bots for DRIP and soon realized his musical skills (or lack thereof) could be weaponized. Now, Rivet's known for clearing out entire sectors with a cacophony of noise.",
