    "name": "Rivet",
    "personality": "Chaotic, Resourceful, and Audacious. Rivet is always looking for an angle, whether it's selling salvaged tech or using his horrific guitar solos to disorient enemies. He's annoyingly optimistic, convinced that someday he'll find a stash of DRIP that will last him a lifetime.",
